#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Umicom Framework
# File: cmake/UmicomRegulatoryReportingGovernancePlatform.cmake
#
# PURPOSE:
#   Extend canonical Umicom::finance with regulatory reporting, taxonomies,
#   data governance, lineage, reconciliations and financial-control services.
#
# ARCHITECTURE:
#   Existing finance, accounting, risk, quantitative and enterprise valuation
#   capabilities remain authoritative. This platform adds governed reporting
#   semantics without moving reusable implementation into applications.
#
# AUTHOR AND ORGANISATION:
#   Sammy Hegab
#   Umicom Foundation
#
# LICENCE:
#   MIT
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
